englishSenses.definition:
n. A chest; hence, a coffin.
n. A stated payment, especially a payment of rent for land;
   hence, the time for such payment.

a. Lost to view; in concealment or ambush; close.
a. Accustomed to, or employed in, desperate enterprises;
   hence, reckless; hopeless.

a. Of or pertaining to strychnine; produced by strychnine;
   as, strychnic compounds; strychnic poisoning
a. used to designate an acid, called also igasuric acid.
